# quest/023/JobRel510_02398 — «Body and Soul» · in play order
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Language: ru\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"X-Game-Version: 2026.09.15.0000.0000\n"
"X-Source-Language: en\n"

#. ja: からくり人形は、静かに佇んでいる。
#. de: Eine Marionette steht im Helix, ganz still und stumm.
#. fr: Ce pantin est immobile, comme s'il était désactivé.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/023/JobRel510_02398:TEXT_JOBREL510_02398_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "The inoperative automaton sits quietly, waiting to be given a purpose."
msgstr ""

#. ja: アルダシールから、ロウェナを呼んできてほしいといわれた。イディルシャイアにいる「ロウェナ」に話しかけよう。
#. de: Ardashir hat dich gebeten, Rowena in Frohehalde darüber zu informieren, dass die neue Anima-Waffe fertiggestellt ist.
#. fr: Ardashir vous a confié qu'il aimerait faire part à Rowena des dernières avancées de l'ex<shy>pé<shy>ri<shy>men<shy>ta<shy>tion sur les esprits synthétiques. Rendez-vous à Idyllée pour lui dire que le jeune garçon l'attend à l'Hélice.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/023/JobRel510_02398:TEXT_JOBREL510_02398_SEQ_01:1"
msgid "Ardashir is ready to present the results of his research to Rowena. Perhaps due to the strange weather in Azys Lla, however, he is unable to contact her using his linkpearl. He bids you travel to Idyllshire and request she come to Azys Lla while he makes final preparations for the anima's unveiling."
msgstr ""

#. ja: ロウェナから、先に戻るように促された。クエストを受注した際のジョブとなり「アニマウェポン」を所持もしくは装備した状態で、アジス・ラーのポート・ヘリックスにいる「アルダシール」に声をかけよう。
#. de: Rowena wird euch einen Besuch abstatten, um die synthetische Seele zu begutachten, sobald sie Zeit hat. Kehre zu Ardashir in Azys Lla zurück.<br><br>※ Stelle sicher, dass du die Anima-Waffe angelegt oder in Besitz hast, und den gleichen Job wie zu Beginn der Auftragsreihe gewählt hast.
#. fr: Ravie d'apprendre que l'ex<shy>pé<shy>ri<shy>men<shy>ta<shy>tion touchait au but, Rowena vous a dit qu'elle vous rejoindrait à l'Hélice après avoir réglé une petite affaire. Retournez auprès d'Ardashir pour lui annoncer la nouvelle.
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/023/JobRel510_02398:TEXT_JOBREL510_02398_SEQ_02:1"
msgid "Rowena is pleased to hear work on the anima weapon is finally complete. Unfortunately, she has unfinished business keeping her in Idyllshire. She asks that you return to Azys Lla ahead of her."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 古いソウルストーンから製作した「もうひとつの人造精霊の身体」をアルダシールから貰った。人造精霊と共に、まだ見ぬ冒険へと向かおう。
#. de: Ardashir hat dir eine Möglichkeit gegeben, die synthetische Seele auch unabhängig von der Anima-Waffe zu manifestieren. Zeig ihr die Welt und erlebe viele spannende Abenteuer mit ihr!
#. fr: Ardashir vous a annoncé avoir fabriqué un nouveau corps pour l'esprit synthétique, en se servant de son ancienne pierre d'âme. Grâce à cette invention, l'être arcanique pourra rester à vos côtés même lorsque vous ne vous servez pas de votre arme anima. Profitez désormais de la compagnie de votre complice en toute situation, au calme avec vos amis comme au plus profond des donjons les plus périlleux<nbsp>!
#. kind: journal
msgctxt "quest/023/JobRel510_02398:TEXT_JOBREL510_02398_SEQ_03:1"
msgid "There is still time before Rowena arrives, and Ardashir seizes the opportunity to present you with a gift. You use the strange device he gives you to summon the anima, and are astonished to see it has taken on a new physical form. Ardashir explains this is made possible using the anima's original soulstone. Rowena arrives soon after to behold the fruits of your hard work. She is pleased with what Ardashir has accomplished, and looks forward to seeing more. When he mentions his plans to seek out a new blacksmith to aid him, all eyes are on Gerolt, who makes clear his intentions to leave now that he is debt free. His liberation is short-lived, however, when Rowena reminds him of the vast sums of gil he has spent since they began work on the anima. Firmly back under Rowena's thumb, he implores Ardashir to accept his help. Meanwhile, the anima suggests you leave to seek out new adventures."
msgstr ""

#. ja: イディルシャイアのロウェナと話す
#. de: In Frohehalde mit Rowena sprechen
#. fr: Parler à Rowena, à Idyllée
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/023/JobRel510_02398:TEXT_JOBREL510_02398_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Speak with Rowena in Idyllshire."
msgstr ""

#. ja: <if ($n4 == 19)><sheet Item 15251 0>と<sheet Item 15264 0><else><if ($n4 == 20)><sheet Item 15252 0><else><if ($n4 == 21)><sheet Item 15253 0><else><if ($n4 == 22)><sheet Item 15254 0><else><if ($n4 == 23)><sheet Item 15255 0><else><if ($n4 == 24)><sheet Item 15259 0><else><if ($n4 == 25)><sheet Item 15260 0><else><if ($n4 == 27)><sheet Item 15261 0><else><if ($n4 == 28)><sheet Item 15262 0><else><if ($n4 == 30)><sheet Item 15256 0><else><if ($n4 == 31)><sheet Item 15258 0><else><if ($n4 == 32)><sheet Item 15257 0><else><if ($n4 == 33)><sheet Item 15263 0></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if>を所持か装備し、<br>ポート・ヘリックスのアルダシールと話す
